      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm crashing repeatedly. Some worlds crash me on join while my friends are unaffected, so I can't join them. I actually crashed so hard that I ended up running the steam and oculus clients and was in two different worlds at the same time. I was also on two different versions of the client, since the oculus one hadn't updated to the latest build. The headset and display were showing the oculus client and obs is showing the steamvr display mirror.",
